message: "If you use GenoScribe in research or technical work, please cite the repository."
title: "GenoScribe: an evidence-first genomics paper review workbench"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-07-01"
authors:
  - name: "GenoScribe contributors"
abstract: "GenoScribe is a local evidence-review workbench for genomics papers and technical documents, focused on provenance-preserving retrieval, structured evidence assembly, and audit-first synthesis."
keywords:
  - genomics
  - evidence review
  - retrieval
  - scientific literature
  - provenance
